{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"billingPlanType","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AppStoreProduct","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/AppStoreProduct","preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@SuperwallKit@objc(cs)SWKAppStoreProduct"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"BillingPlanType","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/AppStoreProduct\/BillingPlanType-swift.enum","preciseIdentifier":"s:12SuperwallKit15AppStoreProductC15BillingPlanTypeO"},{"text":"? { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Paywalls \/ "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PurchaseController"},{"type":"text","text":" implementations can key off this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"directly without separately gating on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isBillingPlanAvailable"},{"type":"text","text":" — the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"value matches what the price\/period accessors are already reporting,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so copy like “Subscribe with monthly commitment” won’t render over"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an upfront-billed purchase."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The dashboard’s "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"intent","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (e.g. “this slot was configured MONTHLY”)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"is preserved via the slot’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swCompositeProductId"},{"text":" if it’s ever","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"needed for analytics; use ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isBillingPlanAvailable"},{"text":" to distinguish","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"“no plan configured” from “configured but unavailable on this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"device.”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit","doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/StoreProduct"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/superwallkit\/storeproduct\/billingplantype"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Apple billing plan "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"that will actually be applied at purchase","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on this device. Returns "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" when no plan is configured on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Superwall Product OR when the configured plan isn’t honored by Apple"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"here (older OS, US\/Singapore for MONTHLY, etc.) — in those cases the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"purchase falls back to Apple’s default plan and so does the value"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"surfaced here.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/StoreProduct\/billingPlanType","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"title":"billingPlanType","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"billingPlanType","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AppStoreProduct","preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@SuperwallKit@objc(cs)SWKAppStoreProduct","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text"